    content: C4-rotationally-symmetric pattern (invariant under 90-degree rotation)
    fill: 50-75% of square cells are foreground
  orbits:
    each C4 orbit of size 4 is either FULL (all 4 present in input) or PARTIAL (exactly 1 of 4 present)
    center orbit (size 1, if side is odd): always fully present
    full orbits: inner orbits closer to center (distance <= ~1.5 cells)
    partial orbits: outer orbits farther from center; 1-5 partial orbits per example
