    2. Design a C4-symmetric pattern in an SxS square by painting orbits.
       For each unique orbit position (r,c) with r <= c and r+c <= side-1 (upper-left triangle),
       decide fg/bg; propagate to all 4 rotated positions with the same color.
       Use body_color for most orbits, accent_color for 1-2 orbits (typically outermost).
